      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo kabyahingwire, nikwo kubona abamalaika banai bemeleire aha ndekelero inai z'ensi, nibanyurura engeli inai z'omuyaga, omuyaga na gumoi gutaija gukahuta nsi anga nyanja anga gukasindika muti gwona gwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshuba mbona omumalaika yayema oburugaizoba yatemba, akwete omuhuri gwa Ruhanga asingire, ayeta abamalaika abanai n'eiraka lihango, ababaire bahairwe obushobora bw'okwita ensi n'enyanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagambira ati, “Mutaita nsi anga nyanja anga miti, kuhika orwo turata emihuri aha buso bw'abairu ba Ruhanga waitu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpulira orubara rw'abatairweho emihuri, 144,000 omuli buli ruganda rw'Abaisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ruganda rwa Yuda abatairweho omuhuri bantu 12,000. Omu ruganda rwa Rubeni bantu 12,000. Omu ruganda rwa Gadi bantu 12,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ruganda rwa Asheri bantu 12,000. Omu ruganda rwa Nafutali bantu 12,000. Omu ruganda rwa Manase bantu 12,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ruganda rwa Simeoni bantu 12,000. Omu ruganda rwa Levi bantu 12,000. Omu ruganda rwa Isakari bantu 12,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ruganda rwa Zebuluni bantu 12,000. Omu ruganda rwa Yozefu bantu 12,000; n'omu ruganda rwa Benjamini abatairweho omuhuri bantu 12,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma kugya kuleba mbona abantu embaga mpango ab'omuntu atakushoboire kubara, abantu aba buli ihanga, ab'enganda zona, abalikugamba endimi zona. Bakaba bemeleire omu mabona g'enketo n'omu mabona ga Kataama, bajwete ekanzu zilikwera, bakwete amatagi g'emikindo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibagamba n'eiraka lihango bati, “Ruhanga waitu asingiire aha nketo na Kataama, nibo baturokora!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamalaika bona bemelera bazingoire enketo, bazingora n'abagurusi n'ebitondwa binai ebilikurora, bajumara ahansi omu mabona g'enketo bafukamira Ruhanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibagamba bati, “Amina! Eirai lyona Ruhanga waitu asingizibwe, atinwe, bamanye okwo n'iwe aba mumanyi, asiimwe, bamukunise, bamanye okwo obushobora n'amani biba bya wenene! Amina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omugurusi omoi ambaza ati, “Naho aba abajwete ekanzu zilikwera ni baahai? Isi baruga nkahai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhorora nti, “Rugaba rwange, n'iwe olikumanya.” Angambira ati, “Aba nibo barugire omu naku zingi; bogize ekanzu zabo omu bwamba bwa Kataama, bazeza katare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo bali omu mabona g'enketo ya Ruhanga nibamukolera kiro na mushana omuli Rwensingaye; kandi wenene ogwo asingire aha nketo naija kubasingira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibalirumwa njara rundi, tibaligira iliho rundi; n'omushana tigulibokya anga kubagiza ichumbano lyona lyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba Kataama asingiire aha nketo n'iwe arabaga mushumba wabo, atega nabatwara aha nchuro z'amaizi g'oburora; kandi Ruhanga naija kubaragaza amalira gona omu maisho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
